WEBVTT

﻿1
00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:41.400
Persistent.

2
00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.570
Come on.

3
00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:00.540
Like this.

4
00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:02.180
Again.

5
00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.110
Slowly?

6
00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:06.120
We need to do it faster.

7
00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:14.720
More.

8
00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:17.590
What's wrong?

9
00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:20.830
Too far?

10
00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.710
Funny guy.

11
00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:30.170
More.

12
00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.780
Here... now.

13
00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.180
Then I'll cheat.

14
00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:48.320
Great.

15
00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:53.500
Come on.

16
00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.230
Did you hit me?

17
00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.400
Oh you freak.

18
00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:17.270
No matter how you show off,
you're just a pathetic nerd.

19
00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:19.620
And I will make your life hell.

20
00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:23.060
You can look for another school.

21
00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:28.180
If a fight starts,

22
00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:30.550
and you catch a blow - you're finished.

23
00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.900
Get close and take him down.

24
00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.390
Get up.

25
00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.120
Damn bastard!

26
00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.390
Let me go, idiot!

27
00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.520
Let me go, I say!

28
00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.450
Crap!

29
00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.860
That's not what I was talking about, crazy guy.

30
00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:07.960
Back off!

31
00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.130
Are you going to make my life hell?

32
00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:11.810
Hey! Moron!

33
00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.360
What kind of freaks you are.

34
00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.280
Don't push, don't push!

35
00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.930
Here's a sneak peek.

36
00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.870
What a scum you are!

37
00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:21.330
Do you know how much I hate school?

38
00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.770
because of assholes like you?

39
00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.180
Everything must have its measure!

40
00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:32.960
Crap.

41
00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.340
Kim Eugyom.

42
00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:53.840
Victory.

43
00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.560
Damn...

44
00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:10.060
Hey, what are you doing? What are you doing?

45
00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:21.200
Stop.

46
00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:23.870
You lost.

47
00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.510
You shouldn't get up.

48
00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.620
Not with your knee.

49
00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.040
Give it back.

50
00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:29.590
Of course, I told him to knock him down,
but not on the stairs.

51
00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.110
You could have broken your own neck.

52
00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:35.530
Of course, I knew that you were unique,

53
00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.430
but it's a shock.

54
00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:39.370
Seungjoon must have shit himself.

55
00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.480
The nerd turned out to be a complete psycho.

56
00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:44.710
Really.

57
00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:47.290
The ability to fight like that is a talent.

58
00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:49.930
Why are you bothering?

59
00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:54.930
Personal curiosity?

60
00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:59.300
The only person
who recognized your talent?

61
00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:04.110
You...

62
00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.140
aren't you fighting?

63
00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:10.650
You're just talking with your tongue.

64
00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:16.840
Coaches… don’t go into the ring themselves.

65
00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.840
Only my eyes are important.

66
00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.440
You and I are similar.

67
00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:25.400
Bastards piss me off too
who are only brave when there is a crowd of them.

68
00:08:26.680 --> 00:08:28.280
Damn jackals.

69
00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:38.580
Kang Yoongi.

70
00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:41.980
Can I have a request?

71
00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.180
Yes, anything.

72
00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:46.150
Give me your suit.

73
00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:52.420
Thank you.

74
00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:54.320
There would be problems at home.

75
00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.990
What are you talking about, nothing.

76
00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:01.080
I'll look on YouTube how to remove the blood.

77
00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.320
Tomorrow I will return the clothes in better condition.

78
00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:04.370
Don't worry.

79
00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:06.420
Thank you.

80
00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.540
Never mind, don't thank me.

81
00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:10.670
I have to go.

82
00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:12.660
Already?

83
00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.630
Would you like to have a snack? Not hungry?

84
00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:16.530
No, I have to go.

85
00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:17.500
Where?

86
00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.720
To the academy. Study.

87
00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:23.540
That's right, you were the first in school.

88
00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.340
A combination of brains and strength.

89
00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.260
I went.

90
00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:29.390
Hey Kim Eugyeom!

91
00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.640
Wait a little.

92
00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:35.770
Catch it.

93
00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.030
This is BB cream.

94
00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.660
Covers up bruises well.

95
00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:41.800
You won't get burned.

96
00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:46.480
Hmmm, I didn’t even say “thank you.”

97
00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:48.980
An unusual guy.

98
00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.590
What a disgrace.

99
00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.210
What to do?

100
00:09:58.290 --> 00:09:59.960
Shut up already, let me think.

101
00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.560
What is there to think about?

102
00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:04.920
If anyone finds out

103
00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.800
the second-year students won't let us live.

104
00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:10.150
We need to deal with him
until they found out.

105
00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:12.660
It was necessary right away. What have we done wrong?

106
00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:14.690
Idiot, they fought one on one.

107
00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:16.810
Three against one is mean.

108
00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.350
What does your fucking attitude have to do with it?

109
00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:45.520
We've been going to the academy for several years,

110
00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:50.020
and you're putting me out because
Did he not have time to solve several problems?

111
00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.800
Then they could have given more time.

112
00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.310
Or at least another chance.

113
00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:03.550
Enough.

114
00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:05.360
Enough, I say!

115
00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:10.890
Come on.

116
00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:12.760
Did you hit me?

117
00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.630
Let go!

118
00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:26.160
Damn bastard!

119
00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:27.440
Eugyom.

120
00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.510
Eugyom.

121
00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:36.920
Eugyom, wake up.

122
00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.020
Eigyom, get up.

123
00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:42.690
Kim Eugyom.

124
00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:46.500
Why are you so scared?

125
00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:48.330
Bad dream?

126
00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:50.900
Yes.

127
00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.700
What did you dream about?

128
00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:00.000
What's wrong with the lip?

129
00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.970
What is this bruise?

130
00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:05.050
I played basketball yesterday
and the ball hit me.

131
00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:10.850
Be careful.

132
00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:14.460
Everything is fine.

133
00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.360
Nothing.

134
00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:50.730
In physical education they teach basketball.

135
00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.630
Different from Seomun School.

136
00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.090
Mother.

137
00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.370
Can I have some more rice?

138
00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.410
- More rice?
- Yes.

139
00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:07.740
Fine.

140
00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.170
Shall I fry some sausages for you?

141
00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:14.180
Let's.

142
00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:18.760
Let's change the academy.

143
00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:22.760
If you get lowered to
average, there will be no point.

144
00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:26.650
I will find out the entrance schedule in others.

145
00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:27.660
Dad.

146
00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:31.200
I'll try.

147
00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:41.310
I can do it, dad.

148
00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:45.110
Is it true?

149
00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:47.920
Will you succeed?

150
00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:49.290
Yes.

151
00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:51.220
Fine.

152
00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:52.920
I'll believe you.

153
00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:54.320
Thank you.

154
00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:56.630
Very tasty.

155
00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:58.730
And yet.

156
00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.400
You can't interrupt your father.

157
00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:06.200
Sorry.

158
00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.010
Eat this too.

159
00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:10.200
Eat more.

160
00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.160
Hey.

161
00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:37.450
Like the coolest first year

162
00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:39.420
lost to some schmuck?

163
00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:40.470
A?!

164
00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:42.960
Hey, simpler face.

165
00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.560
These first years

166
00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:46.060
a lesson needs to be taught.

167
00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:47.710
Choi Hongil.

168
00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.470
Something has gone wrong.

169
00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:51.940
- It's not like that.
- No?

170
00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:53.140
No, damn it.

171
00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:55.490
Kim Seungjoon, what are you doing there? Got up.

172
00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:58.660
Get up, I say!

173
00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:04.710
Hey Seungjoon.

174
00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.540
How could you lose to him?

175
00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:07.680
It's a shame, huh?

176
00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.090
It's just a disgrace.

177
00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.270
Tell me why?

178
00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.640
Because you don't have the courage.

179
00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:15.410
Is fighting a sport?

180
00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:18.090
Are you scoring points?

181
00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:21.840
Lose at least 100 times, one hit
hit the head with a brick - and you're king.

182
00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:24.610
Where has the courage gone?

183
00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.580
You walk around and humiliate yourself.

184
00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:37.930
Crap.

185
00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:44.700
We stood up straight.

186
00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:48.370
Idiots.

187
00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:50.110
You.

188
00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.110
If you don't break his head,

189
00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.070
you're all finished. I don't hear.

190
00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:58.210
Understood.

191
00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:02.494
- Louder!
- Understood!

192
00:16:02.574 --> 00:16:03.453
Understood!

193
00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.910
This is the road to your house, right?

194
00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:29.600
And what? Do you want to go a different route?

195
00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:32.240
That's possible.
You will still come to my house.

196
00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:34.170
The earth is round.

197
00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.520
You got me.

198
00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.810
It doesn't hurt me.

199
00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.580
No offense, I'm a tough guy.

200
00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:41.850
Kang Yoongi.

201
00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.510
Let's talk on the way, otherwise you'll be late.

202
00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:46.960
And if you’re late, your father will write again.

203
00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:48.650
I checked all of YouTube.

204
00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:51.100
I bought peroxide, sodium percarbonate, soda.

205
00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:53.190
I washed your bloody shirt.

206
00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.320
Aren't you happy?

207
00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.760
Hey, did you know

208
00:16:55.840 --> 00:16:57.690
How does peroxide behave with blood?

209
00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.630
Why do I even need to know this?

210
00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:01.240
So ridiculous.

211
00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:08.620
I think this is overkill.

212
00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:12.690
But you can’t disobey Chihyuk either.

213
00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:16.330
We will definitely be expelled for this.

214
00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:19.830
Isn't this too much?

215
00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:29.240
It's coming, it's coming.

216
00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.980
Kim Euigyeom and Kang Yoongi together.

217
00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:43.670
I heard today Seungjoon, Hongil and Jinu

218
00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.490
were among high school students.

219
00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.520
Don't know why?

220
00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:50.530
You won't understand.

221
00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:54.940
This means... you'll have to
fight with the elders.

222
00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.070
I told you so.

223
00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.320
I won't fight.

224
00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:02.160
“I told you, I won’t fight.”

225
00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:04.170
But you still fought.

226
00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:06.400
But don't worry.

227
00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:08.080
You have me, right?

228
00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.410
Their leader is Choi Chihyuk.

229
00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:27.130
He fights with a bamboo sword.

230
00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:31.170
I think he already knows for you.

231
00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:44.370
Kim Seung Joon...

232
00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.440
Kim Seungjoon, you're a fucking psycho!

233
00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.280
Hey, damn, hey, hey!

234
00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.710
Hey Eugyeom, are you okay?

235
00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.720
Hey, hey, wake up, hey, hey!

236
00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.390
Damn, blood.

237
00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:57.160
119.

238
00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.600
It's okay.

239
00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:00.850
Parents will be upset.

240
00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.020
What?

241
00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.990
What are you talking about? Is this more important?!

242
00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:05.400
Don't you dare call.

243
00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:13.360
Eugyom!

244
00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:15.130
Hey, wake up! Crap!

245
00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:17.730
Damn, 119, 119, 119.

246
00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:19.740
Hey, wake up! Crap!

247
00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:20.750
Eugyom!

248
00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:22.850
Eugyom!

249
00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:46.240
What to do, Sugyeom...

250
00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:53.420
Su... Su...

251
00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.030
Kim Eugyom.

252
00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.550
How are you? Everything is fine?

253
00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:31.510
What are you doing?

254
00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:33.060
Wait, I'll call the nurse.

255
00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:35.490
Where are you going?

256
00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:38.380
To the academy.

257
00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:40.250
To the academy? Psycho!

258
00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:42.370
Hey! You can't get up.

259
00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.360
Eugyom!

260
00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.170
- Mother.
-Are you okay?

261
00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.110
Got hurt? Where does it hurt?

262
00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:52.280
What's happened?

263
00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:56.950
Ah, Eugyeom.

264
00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:58.820
Eugyom...

265
00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.020
Sorry.

266
00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:04.450
No, it's okay.

267
00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:13.360
Crap.

268
00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.230
Are we in trouble?

269
00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:20.370
You hit too hard.

270
00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:23.790
You were riding a motorcycle.

271
00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:25.810
Speed ​​had to be taken into account.

272
00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:42.190
Do not tear off the bandage.

273
00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:44.590
Thank you.

274
00:21:56.570 --> 00:21:58.470
Fortunately, everything worked out fine.

275
00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:00.940
Do you know how scared I was?

276
00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:03.950
What's happened?

277
00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:12.790
He fell down the stairs.

278
00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:19.930
What?

279
00:22:20.730 --> 00:22:23.720
From school to stop,
where Eugyeom gets on the bus,

280
00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:24.950
quite far.

281
00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:26.690
That's why we cut it off,

282
00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:27.860
and there is a staircase.

283
00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:29.660
But the steps there are very narrow.

284
00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:32.010
And children often fall there.

285
00:22:32.480 --> 00:22:34.660
I myself fell there in the first semester,

286
00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:37.650
I broke my arm and they inserted a rod into me...

287
00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:39.220
Yes.

288
00:22:56.570 --> 00:22:57.930
What's your place?

289
00:23:00.370 --> 00:23:01.300
What?

290
00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:04.070
Place at school.

291
00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:10.520
I'm a bad student.

292
00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:21.760
I'll go then.

293
00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:24.050
Be careful.

294
00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:25.950
- Goodbye.
- Thank you.

295
00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:26.960
Goodbye.

296
00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:33.060
I'll go too. I need to go to the academy.

297
00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:35.370
Are you only thinking about studying?

298
00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:40.040
Your head is broken.

299
00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:41.710
You will stay.

300
00:23:45.450 --> 00:23:46.520
Sorry.

301
00:23:55.860 --> 00:23:57.160
I didn't want this.

302
00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:00.630
Sorry.

303
00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:06.700
Eugyom.

304
00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:08.770
Yes?

305
00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:12.110
You shouldn't have gotten hurt.

306
00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:15.610
And you can't get sick.

307
00:24:20.080 --> 00:24:21.250
Sorry.

308
00:25:37.960 --> 00:25:39.760
What to do, Sugyeom...

309
00:26:23.470 --> 00:26:24.540
Are you okay?

310
00:26:28.140 --> 00:26:30.080
Should I take you to the hospital?

311
00:26:34.320 --> 00:26:35.320
No.

312
00:26:37.320 --> 00:26:39.140
It will pass soon.

313
00:26:39.220 --> 00:26:40.720
It's OK.

314
00:26:58.740 --> 00:27:00.410
Are you Eugyeom's friend?

315
00:27:04.710 --> 00:27:05.550
What?

316
00:27:08.020 --> 00:27:09.320
The shape is the same...

317
00:27:12.860 --> 00:27:14.720
You came to visit him, didn't you?

318
00:27:18.800 --> 00:27:20.230
Oh yes.

319
00:27:21.060 --> 00:27:22.130
Hello.

320
00:27:24.370 --> 00:27:25.700
Thank you.

321
00:27:26.470 --> 00:27:28.000
That he came all the way here.

322
00:27:33.180 --> 00:27:34.410
How is Eugyeom?

323
00:27:37.310 --> 00:27:38.310
Fortunately,

324
00:27:39.580 --> 00:27:41.150
was not seriously injured.

325
00:27:48.790 --> 00:27:50.830
You must have been very worried.

326
00:27:53.130 --> 00:27:54.400
How great

327
00:27:54.930 --> 00:27:56.190
that our Uygyom

328
00:27:56.270 --> 00:28:00.000
I didn’t have time to really translate,
and have already made friends.

329
00:28:02.010 --> 00:28:04.190
It's time for me to go.

330
00:28:04.270 --> 00:28:05.580
Goodbye.

331
00:28:06.280 --> 00:28:08.440
Won't you visit him?

332
00:28:10.450 --> 00:28:11.310
No.

333
00:28:11.980 --> 00:28:13.980
I just wanted to know how he was.

334
00:28:16.750 --> 00:28:18.240
What's wrong with your face?

335
00:28:18.320 --> 00:28:19.690
Don't touch.

336
00:28:20.990 --> 00:28:23.730
The scar will remain, you need to anoint it with ointment.

337
00:28:26.300 --> 00:28:28.700
Do boys get injured that often?

338
00:28:29.730 --> 00:28:31.630
Mom is probably worried.

339
00:28:38.010 --> 00:28:38.940
Sorry.

340
00:28:41.740 --> 00:28:42.610
For what?

341
00:28:45.010 --> 00:28:46.020
Sorry.

342
00:28:47.250 --> 00:28:48.720
But...

343
00:29:35.200 --> 00:29:36.870
Stop lying around.

344
00:29:38.640 --> 00:29:39.900
Does your back hurt?

345
00:29:47.210 --> 00:29:48.140
I...

346
00:29:50.410 --> 00:29:52.320
I've already met someone like you.

347
00:30:30.590 --> 00:30:31.720
Listen, Eugyeom.

348
00:30:37.290 --> 00:30:39.000
Will you talk to mom?

349
00:30:40.800 --> 00:30:42.030
About what?

350
00:30:44.230 --> 00:30:46.540
I wonder how your school life is.

351
00:30:48.200 --> 00:30:50.470
Have you made any friends?

352
00:30:52.110 --> 00:30:52.980
No.

353
00:30:56.880 --> 00:30:57.880
Maybe...

354
00:30:58.580 --> 00:31:00.680
would you rather take a break from school?

355
00:31:02.390 --> 00:31:03.320
Everything is fine.

356
00:31:05.150 --> 00:31:06.590
No, just rest.

357
00:31:11.130 --> 00:31:14.230
After this you can’t go straight to school.

358
00:31:16.370 --> 00:31:17.300
Mother.

359
00:31:18.640 --> 00:31:20.500
If I don't go, I might fall behind.

360
00:31:24.670 --> 00:31:26.110
Don't want to talk?

361
00:31:29.310 --> 00:31:30.950
Are you blaming me now?

362
00:31:32.750 --> 00:31:34.840
You blame me for everything

363
00:31:34.920 --> 00:31:35.890
right?

364
00:31:51.300 --> 00:31:52.170
Eugyom.

365
00:31:54.870 --> 00:31:56.010
I'm sorry.

366
00:32:01.280 --> 00:32:02.510
For what?

367
00:32:03.780 --> 00:32:05.440
Now it’s not only hard for me,

368
00:32:05.520 --> 00:32:06.700
It's not easy for you either...

369
00:32:06.780 --> 00:32:07.950
Mom.

370
00:32:09.620 --> 00:32:10.890
I need to study.

371
00:33:10.920 --> 00:33:12.640
You're definitely crazy.

372
00:33:12.720 --> 00:33:16.560
I would be happy if I were you
and rested for at least three months.

373
00:33:18.050 --> 00:33:20.310
The way I lied about the stairs yesterday

374
00:33:20.390 --> 00:33:21.720
It was brilliant, wasn't it?

375
00:33:22.290 --> 00:33:25.520
But I was afraid that your father
wants to look.

376
00:33:25.600 --> 00:33:27.440
He could very well do it.

377
00:33:28.400 --> 00:33:30.800
Your father has incredible energy.

378
00:33:34.000 --> 00:33:36.430
You grew up under the supervision of such a father,

379
00:33:36.510 --> 00:33:37.670
that's why you're brave.

380
00:33:38.270 --> 00:33:39.210
Kim Seungjoon.

381
00:33:40.140 --> 00:33:42.230
Moron, who gave permission to call him?

382
00:33:42.310 --> 00:33:44.430
Kim Seungjoon, Kim Seungjoon. So what?

383
00:33:44.510 --> 00:33:45.970
What a moron.

384
00:33:46.050 --> 00:33:48.760
Well, hit it.
I'm wearing glasses, and you'll be wearing an article.

385
00:33:49.590 --> 00:33:50.620
Why did you come?

386
00:33:51.520 --> 00:33:53.690
You should stay at home with a broken head.

387
00:33:56.390 --> 00:33:58.750
I won't talk about
your vile act.

388
00:33:58.830 --> 00:33:59.760
But...

389
00:34:01.560 --> 00:34:03.360
Let's end it here.

390
00:34:06.340 --> 00:34:07.600
Show honor.

391
00:34:14.680 --> 00:34:15.610
Kim Eugyom.

392
00:34:20.120 --> 00:34:21.780
Don't show off in the future

393
00:34:24.320 --> 00:34:25.760
and walk quietly like a mouse.

394
00:34:29.190 --> 00:34:30.030
Understood?

395
00:34:37.300 --> 00:34:38.230
Went.

396
00:34:38.770 --> 00:34:40.370
What? Will you just leave?

397
00:34:40.840 --> 00:34:41.890
Is that possible?

398
00:34:41.970 --> 00:34:43.840
Hey Seungjoon, you're dead.

399
00:34:45.510 --> 00:34:47.400
Damn, they're going to kick us again, right?

400
00:34:47.480 --> 00:34:50.270
I'm going crazy, damn it.

401
00:34:50.350 --> 00:34:52.280
Pathetic guys.

402
00:34:52.980 --> 00:34:54.220
That's great.

403
00:34:54.920 --> 00:34:56.090
It's all over.

404
00:35:06.630 --> 00:35:08.200
Hey Kim Seungjoon.

405
00:35:09.100 --> 00:35:10.700
I asked to bring Uygyom.

406
00:35:11.900 --> 00:35:14.000
You're not listening to me, are you?

407
00:35:14.970 --> 00:35:17.140
Or are you more afraid of him than of me?

408
00:35:24.010 --> 00:35:25.010
I...

409
00:35:25.650 --> 00:35:26.550
this...

410
00:35:27.380 --> 00:35:28.250
I...

411
00:35:29.990 --> 00:35:31.490
Yesterday I humiliated him well,

412
00:35:32.020 --> 00:35:33.990
so that he doesn't stick his head out anymore...

413
00:35:35.890 --> 00:35:37.230
Stay still, freak.

414
00:35:56.080 --> 00:35:57.050
Hey Kim Eugyeom.

415
00:35:57.850 --> 00:35:59.000
Where are you?

416
00:35:59.080 --> 00:36:00.120
This is him.

417
00:36:02.990 --> 00:36:04.890
Eyes down!

418
00:36:11.030 --> 00:36:12.230
Is that you Eugyeom?

419
00:36:17.700 --> 00:36:19.470
Answer when asked.

420
00:36:20.240 --> 00:36:21.860
- Hey Hongil.
- Yes?

421
00:36:21.940 --> 00:36:23.510
Is he always this quiet?

422
00:36:24.310 --> 00:36:25.480
Usually talkative.

423
00:36:26.140 --> 00:36:27.440
Take off your headphones.

424
00:36:30.280 --> 00:36:31.980
Dear high school students!

425
00:36:33.820 --> 00:36:35.250
You will behave like this

426
00:36:35.820 --> 00:36:37.750
I'll have to tell the teacher.

427
00:36:39.360 --> 00:36:41.140
Who are you? His representative?

428
00:36:41.220 --> 00:36:42.510
What are you up to?

429
00:36:42.590 --> 00:36:43.830
I'm not a representative.

430
00:36:44.590 --> 00:36:45.900
More like a mentor.

431
00:36:47.460 --> 00:36:48.670
Listen!

432
00:36:58.270 --> 00:37:00.140
- Choi Hongil.
- Yes?

433
00:37:00.980 --> 00:37:02.550
Aren't you going to get up?

434
00:37:05.350 --> 00:37:07.750
How did such suckers beat you up? Shame.

435
00:37:08.850 --> 00:37:09.810
Hey.

436
00:37:09.890 --> 00:37:10.820
Yes.

437
00:37:11.620 --> 00:37:12.460
Kim Eugyom.

438
00:37:13.190 --> 00:37:15.810
I'll wait for you on the roof after the call.

439
00:37:15.890 --> 00:37:17.150
You'll be a minute late

440
00:37:17.230 --> 00:37:20.430
and you will all live in hell,
until I finish school.

441
00:37:21.100 --> 00:37:22.030
Got it?

442
00:37:35.680 --> 00:37:36.650
Hey.

443
00:37:38.280 --> 00:37:39.550
Why are you showing off?

444
00:37:40.520 --> 00:37:41.400
Tired of living?

445
00:37:41.480 --> 00:37:42.720
What a face.

446
00:37:43.720 --> 00:37:44.890
Sorry.

447
00:37:45.360 --> 00:37:47.540
Have you heard that you shouldn’t anger your elder?

448
00:37:47.620 --> 00:37:49.430
Chihyuk, let's teach him a lesson.

449
00:37:49.890 --> 00:37:51.630
The first-year students lost their fear.

450
00:37:53.280 --> 00:37:54.910
We indulged them too much.

451
00:37:58.970 --> 00:38:00.090
Kim Eugyom.

452
00:38:00.170 --> 00:38:01.100
Yes.

453
00:38:01.970 --> 00:38:03.830
- Uigyom.
- Yes.

454
00:38:03.910 --> 00:38:06.730
Now he answers well.

455
00:38:06.810 --> 00:38:09.410
Why was he silent?
when did the elder ask?

456
00:38:13.380 --> 00:38:14.220
Sorry.

457
00:38:18.620 --> 00:38:20.360
I thought he was dumb.

458
00:38:21.560 --> 00:38:22.690
Sorry.

459
00:38:24.060 --> 00:38:25.260
It's my fault.

460
00:38:26.330 --> 00:38:27.260
Only...

461
00:38:28.730 --> 00:38:29.930
let Yoongi go.

462
00:38:31.230 --> 00:38:32.140
What?

463
00:38:33.670 --> 00:38:35.390
“Let me go,” he says.

464
00:38:35.470 --> 00:38:36.790
How cool.

465
00:38:36.870 --> 00:38:38.500
Just a real Rambo.

466
00:38:38.580 --> 00:38:39.600
OK.

467
00:38:39.680 --> 00:38:42.380
I myself don’t want to hit your friend.

468
00:38:43.580 --> 00:38:45.250
Chatterbox, get out of here.

469
00:38:46.250 --> 00:38:47.680
Ah, lucky to have a friend.

470
00:38:48.250 --> 00:38:49.090
Yes.

471
00:38:53.190 --> 00:38:54.260
But you know, Eigyeom,

472
00:38:55.260 --> 00:38:58.430
I won't forgive you for what you
did with my guys.

473
00:38:59.130 --> 00:39:00.450
Is it your fault?

474
00:39:00.530 --> 00:39:01.460
Yes.

475
00:39:02.130 --> 00:39:04.130
So, punishment is needed, right?

476
00:39:05.170 --> 00:39:06.390
Yes.

477
00:39:06.470 --> 00:39:07.440
Kim Seungjoon!

478
00:39:08.940 --> 00:39:09.840
Come here.

479
00:39:12.980 --> 00:39:14.510
Hurry up, idiot.

480
00:39:15.980 --> 00:39:16.910
Stand here.

481
00:39:24.220 --> 00:39:25.610
This is the end.

482
00:39:25.690 --> 00:39:27.280
Don't touch Eugyeom anymore.

483
00:39:27.360 --> 00:39:28.360
Never mind.

484
00:39:30.530 --> 00:39:31.560
Look at him.

485
00:39:33.260 --> 00:39:34.760
Turn around!

486
00:39:43.040 --> 00:39:44.910
He doesn't want to fight himself.

487
00:39:46.280 --> 00:39:47.340
Leave him alone.

488
00:39:49.750 --> 00:39:51.330
- Kim Eugyeom.
- Yes.

489
00:39:51.410 --> 00:39:53.250
Apologize to my little brother.

490
00:39:54.450 --> 00:39:56.470
“Seungjoon, I’m sorry.”

491
00:39:56.550 --> 00:39:59.320
"I won't do this anymore
and I will do whatever you say.”

492
00:40:00.990 --> 00:40:02.190
Seungjoon, I'm sorry.

493
00:40:03.860 --> 00:40:05.430
I won't do this anymore

494
00:40:06.900 --> 00:40:08.330
and I'll do whatever you say.

495
00:40:11.970 --> 00:40:12.900
Seungjun.

496
00:40:13.700 --> 00:40:15.940
Show me your boxing combination.

497
00:40:16.970 --> 00:40:18.430
Kim Eugyeom, calm down.

498
00:40:18.510 --> 00:40:19.380
Attention.

499
00:40:23.380 --> 00:40:24.310
Seungjun.

500
00:40:24.980 --> 00:40:26.620
Well, give it to him.

501
00:40:27.950 --> 00:40:29.250
Hit him!

502
00:40:34.560 --> 00:40:36.330
What a cutie.

503
00:40:38.630 --> 00:40:39.560
Seungjun.

504
00:40:40.730 --> 00:40:44.880
Make him piss himself
from one word of yours.

505
00:40:45.470 --> 00:40:47.270
Don't act like an idiot.

506
00:40:51.520 --> 00:40:52.610
Hey Kim Seungjoon.

507
00:40:54.280 --> 00:40:55.210
Yes.

508
00:40:56.510 --> 00:40:57.350
Why did you get up?

509
00:40:58.450 --> 00:40:59.740
Smear it.

510
00:40:59.820 --> 00:41:01.000
Hey, hit me, quickly.

511
00:41:01.080 --> 00:41:02.950
Deaf?

512
00:41:13.960 --> 00:41:14.800
Bastard.

513
00:41:26.440 --> 00:41:28.520
The first years went crazy.

514
00:41:28.600 --> 00:41:31.000
You haven't been beaten enough, have you?

515
00:41:31.750 --> 00:41:33.720
Especially you.

516
00:41:35.620 --> 00:41:38.400
I gave you freedom, and you?

517
00:41:55.540 --> 00:41:58.140
Just teach him how not to anger your elder.

518
00:42:12.660 --> 00:42:13.560
What is this?

519
00:42:21.930 --> 00:42:23.290
Hey Kang Yoongi!

520
00:42:23.370 --> 00:42:24.300
A?

521
00:42:25.600 --> 00:42:26.670
How many are there?

522
00:42:27.570 --> 00:42:28.660
Whom?

523
00:42:28.740 --> 00:42:30.910
If I harvest it, how much will be left?

524
00:42:33.440 --> 00:42:34.280
Two!

525
00:42:36.440 --> 00:42:39.240
And if I beat two more, will it all be over?

526
00:42:39.780 --> 00:42:40.620
Yeah.

